          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Construct a bigger house in which all the sides are of length 7 cm."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.177,
            0.834,
            0.22
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Try to recreate ‘A Person’, ‘Wavy Wave’, and ‘Eyes’ from the section ‘Artworkʼ, using ideas involved in the ‘House’ construction."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.224,
            0.833,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Is there a 4-sided figure in which all the sides are equal in length but is not a square? If such a figure exists, can you construct it? Hints"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.298,
            0.789,
            0.32
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A) Eyes",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (from 8.1 Artwork and Construct above (page no. 215)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.325,
            0.834,
            0.412
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Part of the construction is shown earlier. Observe it carefully. You will see two horizontal lines drawn lightly. In geometric constructions, one often constructs supporting curves or figures that are not part of the given figure but help in constructing it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.34,
            0.421,
            0.37,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.265,
            0.511,
            0.705,
            0.662
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.265,
                0.511,
                0.705,
